Under Sampling, folded: up to three rows of a place (halves, thirds, quarters, the middle; a small map) and words; kept in this browser; not sent for Qwen-Image 2.1 (said); Again sends the run's own; the time said grows by a pass a region; the run's line says how many. Twenty-one strings in the eleven catalogs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
